  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_horse_tail_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>the tail of a horse, used in Turkey as an ornament, as a military standard and as an ensign denoting the rank of a pascha (OED s.v. horse-tail)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
